{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1613","id":4082988274,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87zXXTy","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1613","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1613.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1613.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1613","number":1613,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex][9709] Record image-first VLM stop-rule outcome","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis PR executes the bounded image-first external-VLM lane authorized by #1612 and preserves its fail-closed terminal outcome.\n\nIt freezes the exact current `origin/main`, four complete Spring 2022 official 9709 papers, the exact 12-question diagnostic inherited from merged #1577, deterministic render/crop parameters, the minimal visual-truth schema, the current provider/model/endpoint and native-CNY price snapshot, immutable run/checkpoint paths, review-time threshold, and role isolation. Official image bytes and raw candidate responses remain in the repo-external immutable evidence root; the repository contains their hashes, source bindings, cost receipts, matrices, validators, and report.\n\nA separate read-only checker committed official-page observations before producer reveal. It accepted 34/34 source objects and verified 167/167 bound files with zero hash mismatch or blocker.\n\n## Execution result\n\nC0 ran exactly 12/12 authorized diagnostic questions with:\n\n- CNY 0.071160 cumulative provider cost;\n- 100% usage, response-ID, request-hash, response-hash, and image-hash coverage;\n- zero question identity, page-chain, visible-subpart, visible-mark, or required-visual loss;\n- zero next-question/tail-page contamination in the formal fields;\n- zero unauthorized payloads, remote data-service writes, sealed/old-Gold/candidate-answer access, or production/public display.\n\nThe frozen validator then found the same candidate-enhancement schema defect in all 12 responses: `reading_order_notes` and `semantic_notes` were strings instead of arrays. That produced a 100% protocol/schema failure rate and repeated the same critical defect, triggering the issue's mandatory wave stop. C1 and C2 were not called, no schema was loosened, and no immutable response was rewritten or normalized after observation.\n\nThe terminal verdict is `ITERATE_WITH_SMALLER_TRUTH`. No formal object is promoted and no GO, product-readiness, display-rights, or canonical-truth claim is made.\n\n## Main artifacts\n\n- pre-call freeze and four-paper source/render/crop manifest;\n- exact C0 diagnostic manifest and terminal report;\n- immutable raw-package hash inventory;\n- exact usage and native-CNY cost ledger summary;\n- per-question and per-paper acceptance matrix;\n- validator result and zero-side-effect receipt;\n- registered concise final report.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1612_image_first.test.py -v` — 6/6 passed\n- `python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1612_image_first_prepare.py scripts/vlm/issue_1612_image_first_run.py scripts/vlm/issue_1612_image_first_validate.py scripts/vlm/issue_1612_image_first_closeout.py` — passed\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — passed, 0 violations\n- `npm run build` — passed\n- `npm run deploy:secret-scan -- --root .` — passed, 0 findings\n- closeout builder rerun twice — byte-identical and immutable\n- final `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — clean task worktree; report/artifact guard healthy\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\nCloses #1612\n","created_at":"2026-07-18T16:35:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T17:05:38Z","closed_at":"2026-07-18T17:05:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-18T17:05:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"21213a8238a6942cb6a4197d0dec828ce8150dfe","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1613/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1613/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1613/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/442663ce323b40ae89fcaf74ef5f74275b40b1cf","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1612-image-first-external-vlm","ref":"task/1612-image-first-external-vlm","sha":"442663ce323b40ae89fcaf74ef5f74275b40b1cf","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":